#: ../../source/support/index.rst:2
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:8
msgid "工作流保存失败怎么办？"
msgstr "What should I do if the workflow fails to be saved?"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:10
msgid "出现保存失败时，按以下步骤排查："
msgstr "When saving fails, follow these steps to troubleshoot:"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:12
msgid "在工作流编辑页面，点击顶部的 **信息图标（i）** 查看具体报错信息。"
msgstr ""
"On the workflow editing page, click the **Information icon (i)** at the top "
"to view specific error information."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:13
msgid "检查必填参数是否完整（例如输入、模型、可视化和输出模块的关键参数）。"
msgstr ""
"Check that required parameters are complete (e.g. key parameters for input, "
"model, visualization and output modules)."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:14
msgid "确认工作流中各节点的连线无断链或循环错误。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that there are no broken links or loop errors in the connections "
"between nodes in the workflow."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:18
msgid "相机运行后，FPS 过了几分钟仍然显示为 0？"
msgstr ""
"After the camera is running, how many minutes does it take for the FPS to "
"still show 0?"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:20
msgid "这通常说明工作流在运行时出现异常（runtime error）可按以下步骤排查："
msgstr ""
"This usually indicates that a runtime error occurred during the workflow, "
"which can be checked by following the following steps:"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:22
msgid "连接至天眼服务器，将端口 **10350** 转发到本地。"
msgstr ""
"Connect to the Video Analysis Platform server and forward port **10350** to the local "
"computer."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:23
msgid "在浏览器访问 ``http://localhost:10350`` 的 **Tilt** 页面。"
msgstr ""
"Visit the **Tilt** page of ``http://localhost:10350`` in your browser."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:24
msgid "点击打开 **Pipeline Manager**，查看日志与报错信息。"
msgstr "Click to open **Pipeline Manager** to view logs and error messages."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:27
msgid "运行多路视频时，帧数很低怎么办？"
msgstr ""
"What should I do if the frame rate is very low when running multi-channel "
"video?"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:29
msgid "当多路视频并发运行时，若总帧率下降，可尝试以下优化："
msgstr ""
"When multiple videos are running concurrently, if the total frame rate "
"drops, you can try the following optimizations:"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:31
msgid "在 **摄像头输入** 页面，点击右上角的 **提升检测性能** 按钮。"
msgstr ""
"On the **Camera Input** page, click the **Improve Detection Performance** "
"button in the upper right corner."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:32
msgid "在 GPU 设置中适当增加模型实例数（每块 GPU 上可同时加载多个实例），以提升并发推理的整体吞吐量。"
msgstr ""
"Appropriately increase the number of model instances in the GPU settings "
"(multiple instances can be loaded simultaneously on each GPU) to improve the"
" overall throughput of concurrent inference."

