#: ../../source/support/index.rst:231
msgid "使用建议："
msgstr "Suggestions for use:"

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:233
msgid "内存是高并发时的首要瓶颈，97 路 1080p 场景已接近 100% RAM；如需更多路数，建议降分辨率或增加内存。"
msgstr ""
"Memory is the primary bottleneck during high concurrency. The 97-channel "
"1080p scene is close to 100% RAM; if more channels are needed, it is "
"recommended to reduce the resolution or increase the memory."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:234
msgid "GPU 利用率大多在 70–85% 区间，VRAM 充裕（14–77%）；优先关注 RAM 与单路吞吐配置是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"GPU utilization is mostly in the 70–85% range, and VRAM is sufficient "
"(14–77%); priority should be paid to whether RAM matches the single-channel "
"throughput configuration."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:235
msgid "720p 场景显著降低 VRAM 与 RAM，占用同路数可多留冗余。"
msgstr ""
"The 720p scene significantly reduces VRAM and RAM, and the number of shared "
"channels can be used to leave more redundancy."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:236
msgid "1080p 视频单路约占 1.6 GB 内存，720p 单路约 1.5 GB；若开启 live stream，单路约 1.8 GB。"
msgstr ""
"A single channel of 1080p video takes up about 1.6 GB of memory, and a "
"single channel of 720p video takes up about 1.5 GB; if live streaming is "
"turned on, a single channel takes up about 1.8 GB."

#: ../../source/support/index.rst:237
msgid "单路相机+stream 约占用 1 个线程；以 24 线程为标准，可开 16+ 路线程尚可，但往往先受限于 RAM。"
msgstr ""
"A single camera + stream occupies about 1 thread; based on 24 threads as a "
"standard, 16+ lines can be opened, but it is often limited by RAM."
